order=['Aldgate','Tower Hill','Monument','Cannon Street','Mansion House','Aldgate East','Whitechapel','Shoreditch','Stepney Green','Shadwell','Liverpool Street','Bethnal Green','Mile End','Stratford','Bow Road','Moorgate','Barbican','Farringdon','Old Street','Angel','Bank','Waterloo','Southwark','Westminster','Lambeth North','Kennington','Embankment',"St. Paul's",'Chancery Lane','London Bridge','Bermondsey','Borough']
edges=[("Aldgate","Liverpool Street"),("Aldgate","Tower Hill"),("Aldgate East","Liverpool Street"),("Aldgate East","Tower Hill"),("Aldgate East","Whitechapel"),("Angel","Old Street"),("Bank","Liverpool Street"),("Bank","London Bridge"),("Bank","Moorgate"),("Bank","Shadwell"),("Bank","St. Paul's"),("Bank","Waterloo"),("Barbican","Farringdon"),("Barbican","Moorgate"),("Bermondsey","London Bridge"),("Bethnal Green","Liverpool Street"),("Bethnal Green","Mile End"),("Borough","London Bridge"),("Bow Road","Mile End"),("Cannon Street","Mansion House"),("Cannon Street","Monument"),("Chancery Lane","St. Paul's"),("Embankment","Waterloo"),("Embankment","Westminster"),("Kennington","Waterloo"),("Lambeth North","Waterloo"),("Liverpool Street","Moorgate"),("London Bridge","Southwark"),("Mile End","Stepney Green"),("Mile End","Stratford"),("Monument","Tower Hill"),("Moorgate","Old Street"),("Shadwell","Whitechapel"),("Shoreditch","Whitechapel"),("Southwark","Waterloo"),("Stepney Green","Whitechapel"),("Waterloo","Westminster")]
adj={}
for a,b in edges: adj.setdefault(a,set()).add(b); adj.setdefault(b,set()).add(a)
parent={order[0]:None}; path={order[0]:[order[0]]}
for i,n in enumerate(order[1:],1):
    for j in range(i-1,-1,-1):
        if order[j] in adj.get(n,()):
            parent[n]=order[j]; path[n]=path[order[j]]+[n]; break
    else: print("NO PARENT",n)
for n in order: print(len(path[n])-1, path[n])
EOF

